This repository combines content under several licenses. The full license
texts are in LICENSES/.

| Content | License |
| --- | --- |
| Build configuration, fwup configs, scripts, docs (this project's own files) | GPL-2.0-or-later |
| `linux/0001-*.patch` (device tree), `linux/0002/0003-*.patch` (Maxio PHY driver, dwmac-sun8i fix) | GPL-2.0-only (kernel license) |
| `linux/0004-*.patch` (Seekwave VS6621S driver tree, vendor GPL source) | GPL-2.0 per the SPDX identifiers in the source files |
