Downloaded at build time (not in this repository): the Linux kernel
(GPL-2.0-only), U-Boot (GPL-2.0-or-later), Trusted Firmware-A
(BSD-3-Clause), the Seekwave SWT6621S firmware blobs, and Buildroot
packages (various).

The Seekwave firmware is proprietary vendor firmware originating in
the KickPi SDK, fetched at build time from pyavitz/armbian-firmware
(pinned by commit and SHA-256). No redistribution grant from the
rights holder could be verified, so the blobs are not in this
repository and are excluded from legal-info; note that a built system
artifact still contains them, which is a decision point before
publishing artifacts publicly.
